{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は朝から晩までレッスンとリハでした！\n疲れたよ(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れはとれているのだろうか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おい、この筋肉！(ｃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都全握だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題出すよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/20/9132251/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからやるドラマで注目なのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/20/9132251/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなアイスの味は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□全国握手券(応募券部分を切り取ってないやつ)\n(□サイ、閃ブレなど沸く系のグッズ)\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n(□手紙とかプレゼント)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるね(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんのマスカラ使ってるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n全部マジョマジョ！\n落ちにくいから好きでずっとリピしてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスカラどうやって使い分けてる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n前に軽く書いたけど今回は詳しく書きまーす\n・カールをキープするやつ\n・繊維いっぱい入っててとにかく盛れるやつ\n（上まつげの中心と下まつげの目尻側）\n・ロングでセパレートしてくれるやつ\n（上まつげの目尻と下まつげの中心）\n中田の場合、目が細くて離れてるから\n目尻にボリューム出すと\n余計キリッとしすぎちゃうからこうしてるけど\n自分にあったメイクを推奨します(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スマホの設定とか\nなんか心機一転で変えたんだよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字のフォント変えたら\n使ってた顔文字ブサイクだたお(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからはこう見えてたのだろうか(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/07/20/9132251/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n『SUMMER CONFERENCE 2013』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋でえりか様が隣に座ってるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎて腹筋痛い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}